#. な、なんと！
#. このボクとデートしたいと申すか！
msgctxt "0057 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Wh-What!? You want to go on a date with ME!?"
msgstr ""

#. いやぁ、照れちゃうなぁ…
msgctxt "0058 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Ahh, what should I do? I'm so embarrassed, but\n"
"still..."
msgstr ""

#. でも残念ッ！
msgctxt "0059 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "No, I can't!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクは、声を掛けられたくらいで
#. ホイホイついてくような尻軽クマじゃないんです…！
msgctxt "0060 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I don't go out with guys just cuz they talk to me\n"
"nice. What kinda bear floozy do you think I am!?"
msgstr ""

#. とは言え、ここでわざわざ
#. ボクに話しかけて来た苗木クンに…
msgctxt "0061 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But hey, since you came all this way to talk to me..."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっといい事、教えちゃおっかな！
msgctxt "0062 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...I'll give you something extra special!"
msgstr ""

#. 実はね、ボクには見えるんだ…
msgctxt "0063 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Cuz you know what? I can see it..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンがどのぐらい
#. 好かれているのか見えちゃうんだよッ！
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I can see how much everyone likes you!"
msgstr ""

#. 何でも数値で示されないと安心出来ないオマエの為の
#. サービス機能なのでーす！
msgctxt "0065 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's a special service for those of you who just can't\n"
"have fun unless you can see all the numbers!"
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、これって逆に言うと…
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But there's another side to the coin..."
msgstr ""

#. 嫌われてる相手もわかっちゃうって事なんだ…
#. その辺、覚悟出来てる？
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You'll also be forced to see who *doesn't* like you.\n"
"Are you sure you can handle it?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ！
#. じゃあ、ちょっとチェックしてみよっか！
msgctxt "0068 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu! Okay then, let's take a little peek!"
msgstr ""

#. おやおや、みんなとの関係を知りたいの？
msgctxt "0069 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ohh, you wanna know how you're doing with everyone?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ！
#. じゃあ、ちょっとチェックしてみよっか！
msgctxt "0070 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu! Okay then, let's take a little peek!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンとみんなの関係は…
msgctxt "0071 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "So, your relationship with everyone else..."
msgstr ""

#. こーんな感じだね！
msgctxt "0072 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "It looks a little something...like this!"
msgstr ""

#. ヘイ、いい感じぃ？
msgctxt "0073 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "So? You feel good about it?"
msgstr ""

#. どうっすか？　どうっすか？
msgctxt "0074 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Whaddya think? Whaddya think!?"
msgstr ""

#. 嫌われちゃったりしてない？
msgctxt "0075 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Are you sure everyone doesn't actually hate you?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0076 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Puhuhuhu..."
msgstr "U pư pư pư..."

#. ん？　この結果にご不満ですか？
msgctxt "0077 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm? Are you unhappy with the results?"
msgstr ""

#. もっと好かれたいんだったら…
msgctxt "0078 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well, if you want people to like you better..."
msgstr ""

#. おでかけチケットを使って
#. 相手を楽しませればいいんじゃない？
msgctxt "0079 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...why don't you Use a Trip Ticket and show your\n"
"buddy a good time!?"
msgstr ""

#. 要は、ごきげんを取れって事だね！
msgctxt "0080 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What I'm saying is, you gotta curry that favor!"
msgstr ""

#. ただし…どんなにイイ関係になっても、
#. 相手の深いところを知らないと意味はない…
msgctxt "0081 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But it doesn't matter how smoothly things go, if you\n"
"can't get to your pal's deepest spots..."
msgstr ""

#. 青年の主張みたいな恥ずかしーい大暴露大会は
#. 始まらないからね～？
msgctxt "0082 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...then you'll be able to face each other and confess\n"
"all your darkest, most awesomest secrets!"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0083 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0084 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり今日はもう休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Should I call it a day already?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

